# Alibaba Cloud / Aliyun / AliCDN overseas IPv4 prefixes
# Snapshot 2026-11-28 Asia/Singapore (UTC+8)
# Sources: RIPEstat announced-prefixes (query_end 2026-11-28T00:00:00 UTC) for AS45102, AS37963, AS24429, AS134963
# Cross-checked with bgp.he.net prefix descriptions and APNIC delegated-apnic-latest
# Geo check: iptoasn.com ip2country-v4 (dated 2026-11-01) + ipdeny CN aggregated
# INCLUDED: overseas announcements (HK/MO/TW treated as overseas).
#   AS45102 = Alibaba Cloud International (Alibaba (US) Technology Co., Ltd.)
#   AS134963 = Alibaba Cloud (Singapore) Private Limited
#   AS24429 = Alibaba Cloud CDN (AliCDN / Taobao), overseas slices only
#   AS37963 = Alibaba Cloud China; only clearly non-mainland slices, if any
# EXCLUDED from this recommended list:
#   - All AS37963 announcements at this snapshot (mainland China ASN; peers only with CN carriers/IXes)
#   - 8.128.0.0/10 (APNIC SG legal allocation, but Aliyun China-region public space; geo CN)
#   - Other China-mainland prefixes (APNIC CC=CN + CN geo/org, e.g. 39.96/13, 47.92+, 116.251.64/18, 140.205, 223.4/14)
#   - High-risk DNS: 223.5.5.0/24 and 223.6.6.0/24 (AliDNS 223.5.5.5 / 223.6.6.6), even though AS45102 also announces them
#   - 203.107.0.0/16 slices (Alibaba Cloud DNS / HTTPDNS)
#   - AS45096 / AS45103 / AS45104 exist as Alibaba-related but were not announcing IPv4 at this snapshot
#   - Non-Alibaba lookalikes checked and not used: AS136907 Huawei Cloud, AS55967 Baidu, AS137718 Volcano Engine
# Do not use a covering 43.0.0.0/9, 8.0.0.0/8, or 8.128.0.0/10 — those are not overseas-Aliyun-only.
# 8.208.0.0/12 is almost fully announced except hole 8.209.32.0/22; this list uses announced prefixes, not the whole /12.
# BGP announcements change; this is a snapshot.
